TapiocaOptionBroker_canLockWithDebt.tree
├── given user has no BigBang debt
│   └── it should return true with max amount as buffer
├── given user has BigBang debt
│   ├── when amount + total locked exceeds max allowed
│   │   └── it should return false with calculated max amount
│   └── when amount + total locked is within limits
│       └── it should return true with calculated max amount
└── it should always return correct minted USDO amount
